{"id":"29a0403e0c65ae9d","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-soundness-fo.md","title":"Soundness of First-Order Logic","display":"lem-soundness-fo — Soundness of First-Order Logic","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-soundness-fo","aliases":["92-lem-soundness-fo"],"display":"lem-soundness-fo — Soundness of First-Order Logic","depends_on":["[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-soundness-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-soundness-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-soundness-fo — Soundness of First-Order Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c75bb5270ee96d5a\" href=\"?note=c75bb5270ee96d5a\" title=\"92-df-logical-consequence\">92-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (premise set and conclusion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span> (logical axioms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (modus ponens and theorem-level generalization, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\Phi\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\)</span> (the standard Hilbert calculus over the premises <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\Phi,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\Phi,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶逻辑可靠性：在上面明确固定的演算中可推导，蕴含语义后承；未定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>记号已由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>取代</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>推导，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>的模型中真</li>\n<li>证明：验证推理规则保持真理性\n<ul>\n<li>Modus Ponens：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\to \\psi\\)</span>真，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>真</li>\n<li>Generalization：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在所有赋值下真，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi\\)</span>真；这里<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>只含句子，所以不存在变量在未解除前提中自由出现的问题</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>可靠性是比完备性更基本的结果</li>\n<li>对系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的应用还需模型满足其全部非逻辑公理；若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，才可推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axioms, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}$ (modus ponens and theorem-level generalization, see [[92-ax-modus-ponens]] and [[92-ax-generalization]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}$ (modus ponens and theorem-level generalization, see [[92-ax-modus-ponens]] and [[92-ax-generalization]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\Phi,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\to \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2065,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_\\Phi$ (definition target for the same premise calculus as in [[92-lem-soundness-fo]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-soundness-fo]]"}],"outgoing":["c75bb5270ee96d5a","51c43e0240787ebb","d666a3e3ee6c8148","e948c25f4a467fa1","16613851c4bce386","906680bfce5f44c0"]}